# The floor `make cover` enforces, per package. The number is where the package is today,
# rounded down: a floor is a ratchet, so it may only move up. Raise one when its package goes
# up, never lower one to make a run green.
#
# The target is 95% for everything. Where a package cannot reach it, the line says why in one
# clause — and the reason is a fact about the code, not about the test suite.

cmd/acornfall        68   -- root, a namespace, or an os.Exit: the plan's application, the probe re-exec, netns
internal/control     80
internal/httpapi     68
internal/netns       33   -- a netlink shim: needs CAP_NET_ADMIN to run at all
internal/protocol   100
internal/ready       83
internal/sandbox     78
internal/supervise   84
internal/update      77
internal/vault       82
internal/workerpool  85
web                  75
